_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png/45px-Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png/60px-Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Inquisitor of the Absolute\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png/30px-Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Portrait_Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute_Drow_Half-Elf.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Inquisitor of the Absolute\">Inquisitor of the Absolute</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider\" title=\"Phase Spider\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Portrait_Phase_Spider.png/30px-Portrait_Phase_Spider.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Portrait_Phase_Spider.png/45px-Portrait_Phase_Spider.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Portrait_Phase_Spider.png/60px-Portrait_Phase_Spider.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Portrait_Phase_Spider.png/30px-Portrait_Phase_Spider.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Portrait_Phase_Spider.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider\" title=\"Phase Spider\">Phase Spider</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><pictur